            "description": "Save this response to training/data/invoices_page1.json\n\nThen produce, in Python:\n  F2  one row per line item  (carry the invoice header down)\n  F3  one row per posting    (carry invoice AND line down)\n\nThen reconcile -- but at the INVOICE level, not per line: every\ninvoice's postings must sum to exactly 0.00, the way a real\ndouble-entry journal entry balances (expense + VAT, both debit,\nagainst Vendor Payable, credit). It does balance -- if yours\ndoesn't, look at the dtype of your money column.",
            "body": {
